\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Three levels of dialogic interaction. In weak-asymmetric dialogue, only the user models the AI who produces outputs based on prompts or requests. In pseudo-dialogue, a level of communication takes place but the collaboration and mutual modelling is limited. In full-dialogue, both model each other and act and evaluate the common creation. Figure from \cite  {Bown2024-yx}}}{59}{figure.caption.66}\protected@file@percent }
